WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:17.221
Red Fox went into her den.

2
00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:21.500
"Home, sweet home!" she said.

3
00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:24.332
Red Fox looked around.

4
00:00:24.332 --> 00:00:29.047
She saw a trail of dirty footprints.

5
00:00:29.047 --> 00:00:32.839
Her pretty rug was muddy.

6
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:50.910
Red Fox gasped. "What a mess!"

7
00:00:50.911 --> 00:00:54.380
Then she spotted Tommy Brock.

8
00:00:54.380 --> 00:01:00.938
The badger was asleep—in her bed!

9
00:01:00.938 --> 00:01:03.862
Red Fox was angry.

10
00:01:03.862 --> 00:01:07.779
"That rotten badger!" she thought.

11
00:01:07.779 --> 00:01:11.311
"I must teach him a lesson!"

12
00:01:11.312 --> 00:01:17.342
Red Fox thought of a plan.

13
00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:22.215
She hurried outside.

14
00:01:22.216 --> 00:01:33.574
She filled a bucket with water.

15
00:01:33.575 --> 00:01:40.261
Then Red Fox slipped back into her den.

16
00:01:40.261 --> 00:01:44.731
Tommy was dreaming about his dinner.

17
00:01:44.731 --> 00:01:47.919
"I'll have the bunnies first.

18
00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:52.400
Then I'll eat the eggs and—Hey!"

19
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:56.729
Splash! Water poured all over Tommy.

20
00:01:56.729 --> 00:02:00.074
"Surprise!" Red Fox cried.

21
00:02:00.075 --> 00:02:03.044
"Huh?" Tommy sat up.

22
00:02:03.045 --> 00:02:06.570
"Get out of my den!" Red Fox yelled.

23
00:02:06.571 --> 00:02:09.882
Tommy jumped out of bed.

24
00:02:09.882 --> 00:02:15.205
He ran and got the eggs.

25
00:02:15.206 --> 00:02:18.894
Flopsy hopped closer to the den.

26
00:02:18.895 --> 00:02:23.431
She peeked inside.

27
00:02:23.432 --> 00:02:25.752
Crack! Splat!

28
00:02:25.753 --> 00:02:30.959
Tommy was throwing eggs at the angry fox!
